        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Cooperative Living Organization, Collegiate Living Organization\n- Places: Gainesville, Florida, Alachua County, Florida, United States\n- Topics: student-governed cooperative living organizations\n\nFacts:\n- Cooperative Living Organization, formerly called Collegiate Living Organization, is in Gainesville, Florida.\n- Cooperative Living Organization is one of the oldest continuously operating independent student-governed cooperative living organizations in the United States.\n- Gainesville is the county seat of Alachua County, Florida.\n- Gainesville is the largest city in Alachua County, Florida.\n- Gainesville is the principal city of the Gainesville, Florida Metropolitan Statistical Area in the United States.",
